rue,"reward":false,"firstImg":"https://xqimg.imedao.com/1728d77cee719ae33fe48f18.jpeg","rawTitle":"想报考财经大学？刚刚！2020年财经院校最新排行榜公布！","tagStr":"","longTextForIOS":false,"topic_pic_thumbnail_small":null,"topic_pic_thumbnail":null,"topic_pic_headOrPad":null,"tagsForWeb":";","reply_count":0,"meta_keywords":null,"paid_mention":null,"reward_count":0,"reward_amount":0,"reward_user_count":0,"talk_count":0,"like_count":0,"video_info":null,"quote_cards":null,"promotion_pic":null,"promotion_url":null,"promotion_id":0,"mark_desc":null,"pic_sizes":[{"width":900,"height":383},{"width":640,"height":2895},{"width":475,"height":605},{"width":640,"height":1355},{"width":640,"height":270}],"cover_pic_size":null,"order_id":0,"tags":[],"status_industry":null,"excellent_comments":[],"notice_tag":null,"common_emotion":null,"current_stock_price":null,"new_card":null,"source_deep_link":null,"source_feed":false,"editable":true,"like_config":null,"title_ad_pic":null,"title_ad_url":null,"title_ad_deep_link":null,"answer_comment":null,"answer_count":0,"answer_users":null,"bonus_screen_name":null,"fundx_tag":null,"extend_st_feed_info":{"stock_event_time":0,"stock_event_type":null,"change_event_color":null,"is_future_event":false,"stock_event_id":null,"stock_event_message":null,"original_text_length":505,"disputed_status":false,"excellent_status":"false"},"stock_list":null,"reply_user_images":null,"reply_user_count":0,"fundx_symbol":null,"hot_new_rank":null,"image_info_list":[{"filename":"1728d77cee719ae33fe48f18.jpeg","width":900,"height":383,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"1728d77d0551992f3fef99df.jpeg","width":640,"height":2895,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"1728d77d29d19b2d3fd662d0.png","width":475,"height":605,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"1728d77d46f198463fecf11f.jpeg","width":640,"height":1355,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"1728d77d67f198793fe7c6e2.jpeg","width":640,"height":270,"ocr_result":null}],"extend_st_home_page":{"ip_location":"","st_mention_stock_count":0,"ai_card":null,"ai_status":false,"speech_enable":false,"speech_info":null},"censor_state":0,"forbidden_retweet":false,"vod_info":null,"text":"<p>小福利，发送“606”获取为您定制的财务日历</p> <p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/1728d77cee719ae33fe48f18.jpeg\" /></p> <p>距离2020年高考只有一个月的时间了，在今年这个特殊年份，考生和家长都比较紧张，期待考个好成绩，报个好学校。</p> <p><b>财经类大学一直以来都是经久不衰的一类报考热门院校，</b><b>今天就介绍一下我国财经类大学</b><b>。</b>刚刚，<b>软科中国</b>发布了2020年全国51所财经类大学排名，两财一贸位列前三甲，<b>上海财经大学位居榜首，中央财经大学第二名，对外经济贸易大学第三名；</b>紧随其后的就是中南财经政法大学和西南财经大学。</p> <p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/1728d77d0551992f3fef99df.jpeg\" /></p> <p>近日，中国科教网也公布了2020-2021年的财经类大学排名，<b>中央财经大学排名第一。</b>根据排名显示，中央财经大学，上海财经大学，对外经济贸易大学，中南财经政法大学，西南财经大学位居全国财经类院校的前5强。</p> <p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/1728d77d29d19b2d3fd662d0.png\" /></p> <p>另外，还有2020校友会财经类大学排名，发布在下面，有兴趣的同学可以对比看一下。校友会这个排名将中南财经政法大学排在第一名，感觉有些离谱，中南财大确实很好，但还是要比两财一贸逊色一些。</p> <p><b>2020中国财经类大学排名（校友会版）</b></p> <p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/1728d77d46f198463fecf11f.jpeg\" /></p> <p><b>任何排名都伴有巨大争议，大家仅供参考，不必过于纠结。</b></p> <p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/1728d77d67f198793fe7c6e2.jpeg\" /></p> <p>小福利，发送<b>“606”</b>获取为您定制的<b>财务日历</b></p>","show_cover_pic":true,"legal_user_visible":false,"is_column":false,"recommend_cards":null,"is_answer":false,"is_refused":false,"is_ss_multi_pic":false,"is_bonus":false,"cover_pic":"","pic":"https://xqimg.imedao.com/1728d77cee719ae33fe48f18.jpeg,https://xqimg.imedao.com/1728d77d0551992f3fef99df.jpeg,https://xqimg.imedao.com/1728d77d29d19b2d3fd662d0.png,https://xqimg.imedao.com/1728d77d46f198463fecf11f.jpeg,https://xqimg.imedao.com/1728d77d67f198793fe7c6e2.jpeg","answer_question":false,"is_no_archive":false,"is_original_declare":false,"mp_not_show_status":false,"forbidden_comment":false,"is_private":false}